                                                                                
*                                                                               
*  FUNKTION   :  TEMP-FIL IN FRÅN W15100, LISTA UT                              
*                                                                               
*  FÖRFATTARE :  GUNNEL ERIKSSON    880805                                      
*                                                                               
*  INFILER    :  W15102D1                                                       
*                                                                               
*  UTFILER    :  W15102D2                                                       
*             :  W15102D3                                                       
*                                                                               
*  ÄNDRING    :  - ÄNDRAT TILL EPLUS FRÅN REPORT WRITER, 880805                 
*  ÄNDRING    :  - TILLAGT DD-KORT FÖR BRASILIEN-PRINT,  890602                 
*  ÄNDRING    :  - TILLAGT DD-KORT FÖR PV-REDAKTION      911023                 
*                                                                               
*     DATUM       NAMN                     AVD                                  
*     890602..    C.EGHOLT............     36210.........                       
*     911023..    C.EGHOLT............     30621.........                       
*     ........    ....................     ..............                       
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
*--------------------------INFIL------------------------------------            
  FILE  W15102D1                                                                
*                                                                               
 %W15101EE 'IN-'                                                                
*------------------------SORTFIL ------------------------------------           
  FILE  W15102DS        FB (346 6228)                                           
*                                                                               
 %W15101EE 'SORT-'                                                              
*-------------------------PRINTFILER--------------------------------            
FILE W15102D4 PRINTER                                                           
*                                                                               
*-------------*                                                                 
* ARBETSAREOR *                                                                 
*-------------*                                                                 
 W-55-ASTERISKER            W  55 A VALUE +                                     
 '*******************************************************'                      
 W-7-ASTERISKER            W  7 A VALUE '*******'                               
 W-FOTNOT-IDFOTNR          W             5 N                                    
 W-FOTNOT-IDFOTNR-1   W-FOTNOT-IDFOTNR   1 N                                    
 W-KDPRTVAL                W  1 A                                               
*                                                                               
 SPRAK-KODER  W 30 A  VALUE +                                                   
                      'D  +                                                     
                       E  +                                                     
                       F  +                                                     
                       GB +                                                     
                       I  +                                                     
                       NL +                                                     
                       P  +                                                     
                       S  +                                                     
                       SF +                                                     
                       USA'                                                     
*                                                                               
 SPRAK-KOD SPRAK-KODER 3 A, OCCURS (10) INDEX (INDX)                            
                                                                                
SPRAK  W 240 A  VALUE +                                                         
                      'TYSKA       GERMAN      +                                
                       SPANSKA     SPANISH     +                                
                       FRANSKA     FRENCH      +                                
                       ENGELSKA    ENGLISH     +                                
                       ITALIENSKA  ITALIAN     +                                
                       HOLLÄNDSKA  DUTCH       +                                
                       PORTUGISISKAPORTUGUESE  +                                
                       SVENSKA     SWEDISH     +                                
                       FINSKA      FINNISH     +                                
                       AMERIKANSKA AMERICAN    '                                
*                                                                               
 SPRAK-TEXT  SPRAK 24 A, OCCURS (10) INDEX (INDX)                               
*                                                                               
 SPRAK-SPRAK SPRAK-TEXT 12 A, OCCURS (2) INDEX (S-IX)                           
*                                                                               
*--------------------COPY-TEXT--------------------------------------            
 %WTXTAREA                                                                      
*                                                                               
*--------------------LIST-POST--------------------------------------            
 LIST-FOTNOT-IDFOTNR      W  5 N MASK  'ZZZZZ'                                  
 LIST-FOTNOT-IDFOTNR-1 LIST-FOTNOT-IDFOTNR         1 N                          
 LIST-FOTNOT-SPRAK        W 12 A                                                
 LIST-FOTNOT-FLOVERSATT   W  1 A                                                
 LIST-FOTNOT-BEFOTNOT     W 55 A, OCCURS (6) INDEX (INDX)                       
 LIST-ASTERISK            W  7 A                                                
                                                                                
*    -- CHECKED BY WY2000                                                       
*-------------*                                                                 
* JOB         *                                                                 
*-------------*                                                                 
*                                                                               
 SORT W15102D1 TO W15102DS USING (IN-FOTNOT-IDFOTNR) +                          
 BEFORE SORT-PROC                                                               
*                                                                               
  SORT-PROC                                                                     
  PROC                                                                          
    IF W15102D1                                                                 
       SELECT                                                                   
    END-IF                                                                      
  END-PROC                                                                      
*                                                                               
*---------------------------------------------*                                 
*                      JOB                    *                                 
*---------------------------------------------*                                 
JOB INPUT W15102DS                                                              
*                                                                               
 W-FOTNOT-IDFOTNR = SORT-FOTNOT-IDFOTNR                                         
 W-KDPRTVAL = SORT-FOTNOT-KDPRTVAL                                              
    S-IX = 1                                                                    
 PERFORM A-KTR-SPRAK-PROC                                                       
 PERFORM B-KTR-BEFOTNOT                                                         
*                                                                               
*---------------------------------------------*                                 
*              A-KTR-SPRAK-PROC               *                                 
*---------------------------------------------*                                 
A-KTR-SPRAK-PROC                                                                
PROC                                                                            
INDX = 1                                                                        
DO WHILE INDX < 11                                                              
   IF SPRAK-KOD(INDX) = SORT-FOTNOT-IDSKYLT                                     
      LIST-FOTNOT-SPRAK = SPRAK-SPRAK(INDX, S-IX)                               
      INDX = 10                                                                 
   END-IF                                                                       
   INDX = INDX + 1                                                              
END-DO                                                                          
END-PROC                                                                        
*                                                                               
*---------------------------------------------*                                 
*                B-KTR-BEFOTNOT               *                                 
*---------------------------------------------*                                 
B-KTR-BEFOTNOT                                                                  
PROC                                                                            
INDX = 1                                                                        
DO WHILE  INDX < 7                                                              
    LIST-FOTNOT-IDFOTNR = 0                                                     
    LIST-FOTNOT-FLOVERSATT = ' '                                                
    LIST-FOTNOT-BEFOTNOT(INDX) = ' '                                            
    LIST-ASTERISK = ' '                                                         
*                                                                               
    IF INDX = 1                                                                 
       IF SORT-FOTNOT-FLOVERSATT = 'N'                                          
          LIST-FOTNOT-FLOVERSATT = SORT-FOTNOT-FLOVERSATT                       
       END-IF                                                                   
*                                                                               
       LIST-FOTNOT-IDFOTNR = SORT-FOTNOT-IDFOTNR                                
*                                                                               
       IF SORT-FOTNOT-BEFOTNOT(1) = W-55-ASTERISKER                             
          LIST-ASTERISK = W-7-ASTERISKER                                        
       ELSE                                                                     
          RTXT-TETEXTTR = SORT-FOTNOT-BEFOTNOT(1)                               
          RTXT-KDTEXTTR = 'V'                                                   
          CALL WTXTTR USING RTXT-WTXTAREA                                       
          IF RTXT-KDSVAR = ' '                                                  
             LIST-FOTNOT-BEFOTNOT(1) = RTXT-TETEXTTR                            
          END-IF                                                                
       END-IF                                                                   
*                                                                               
       IF W-KDPRTVAL = 'C'                                                      
         PRINT RAPPORT03                                                        
       END-IF                                                                   
    ELSE                                                                        
       IF SORT-FOTNOT-BEFOTNOT(INDX) NE ' '                                     
          RTXT-TETEXTTR = SORT-FOTNOT-BEFOTNOT(INDX)                            
          RTXT-KDTEXTTR = 'V'                                                   
          CALL WTXTTR USING RTXT-WTXTAREA                                       
*                                                                               
          IF RTXT-KDSVAR = ' '                                                  
             LIST-FOTNOT-BEFOTNOT(INDX) = RTXT-TETEXTTR                         
             IF W-KDPRTVAL = 'C'                                                
               PRINT RAPPORT03                                                  
             END-IF                                                             
          END-IF                                                                
*                                                                               
       END-IF                                                                   
    END-IF                                                                      
    INDX = INDX + 1                                                             
END-DO                                                                          
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
*---------------------------------------------*                                 
* REPORT            RAPPORT 03                *                                 
*---------------------------------------------*                                 
*                                                                               
* LISTA TILL PRINTER MED KDPRTVAL = C                                           
*                                                                               
  REPORT RAPPORT03  PRINTER W15102D4  +                                         
                    LINESIZE 120    +                                           
                    NOADJUST        +                                           
                    NOHEADING       +                                           
                    NODATE                                                      
                                                                                
         CONTROL    FINAL NOPRINT  +                                            
                    W-FOTNOT-IDFOTNR-1 NEWPAGE +                                
                    NOPRINT                                                     
                                                                                
    TITLE 1 COL   4 'W15102-001 - VOLVO CAR AFTERSALES. -' +                    
            COL  42 'LISTA ÖVER FOTNOTER, NR-ORDNING,' +                        
            COL  75  SORT-FOTNOT-KDFORDON +                                     
            COL  90 'DATUM:' +                                                  
            COL  96  SYSDATE                                                    
*                                                                               
    TITLE 4 COL   4 'FOTNOTSNUMMER' +                                           
            COL  23 'Ö' +                                                       
            COL  30  LIST-FOTNOT-SPRAK +                                        
            COL  98 'ÖVERSÄTTNING SAKNAS'                                       
*                                                                               
    TITLE 5         ' '                                                         
*                                                                               
    LINE  1 COL   6 LIST-FOTNOT-IDFOTNR +                                       
            COL  23 LIST-FOTNOT-FLOVERSATT +                                    
            COL  30 LIST-FOTNOT-BEFOTNOT(INDX) +                                
            COL 103 LIST-ASTERISK                                               
*                                                                               
    LINE  2         ' '                                                         
*                                                                               
